# A clarinet: a cylindrical bore closed at one end, so the odd harmonics
# lead and the even ones are faint; held at a sustain level, darker as it
# softens. Not in the standard library: an example of a new voice.
name clarinet
family winds
n 10
harmonics 1 1.0  2 0.05  3 0.75  4 0.04  5 0.5  6 0.03  7 0.35  8 0.02
harmonics 9 0.2  10 0.015  11 0.12  12 0.01  13 0.08  15 0.05  17 0.03  19 0.02
bright 0.2
timbres 0 10 20
start 30 dB
attack 0.03 s
peak 0 dB
decay 2 dB/s
sustain 4 dB
release 0.08 s
